Third-party notice: Orbit

Dialed's dial-decoding approach (reading turns as AVRCP absolute-volume steps
on a 16-step grid, restoring the level after each click, mapping presses to
media commands, compensating fast spins, and the default gesture design) is
based on Orbit's research and documentation:
https://github.com/harsha20599/orbit

